WEBVTT

00:11:29.173 --> 00:11:32.487
in passing on a healthier earth.

00:11:32.511 --> 00:11:35.892
And it worries me when I read
the "Bulletin of Atomic Scientists"

00:11:35.916 --> 00:11:39.347
and see now that we are
two minutes from midnight,

00:11:39.371 --> 00:11:40.599
and that's gotten closer.

00:11:40.623 --> 00:11:43.496
We have put our future

00:11:43.520 --> 00:11:47.409
and our children's future
and safety at risk

00:11:47.433 --> 00:11:51.053
in a world that is still
too much governed by violence.

00:11:51.077 --> 00:11:52.649
We must end that.

00:11:52.673 --> 00:11:57.500
We must stop investing in war and start
investing in the young and in peace,

00:11:57.524 --> 00:11:59.943
and we are really so far away
from doing that.

00:11:59.967 --> 00:12:01.039
(Applause)